# ROOT ACCESS : 07
## THE UNIFIED DIGITAL UNIVERSE
### ROOT ACCESS × GHOSTNET × BLACKBOX

Build a complete, immersive, cinematic, full-stack interactive digital universe called **ROOT ACCESS : 07**.

This project combines three interconnected experiences into one persistent fictional world:

- ROOT ACCESS — the operating system, terminal, command interface, identity, permissions, system memory, and control center.
- GHOSTNET — the enormous fictional underground network containing nodes, servers, hidden identities, transmissions, abandoned infrastructure, digital entities, encrypted locations, and secrets.
- BLACKBOX — the investigation engine containing classified incidents, missing personnel, evidence, contradictory records, timelines, conspiracies, and narrative revelations.

These are NOT three separate websites.

These are NOT three independent games.

These are NOT three navigation tabs containing unrelated features.

They are three interconnected layers of one living digital universe.

The user must be able to move naturally between them, with discoveries, commands, files, evidence, missions, access levels, and narrative events affecting all three.

I do not want a conventional website.

I want something that feels like an unknown digital world the user has accidentally entered, and the deeper they go, the harder it becomes to understand where the system ends and the mystery begins.

The project should feel dark, intelligent, immersive, unsettling, technically impressive, visually extraordinary, interactive, and obsessively discoverable.

