## Example discovery chain

The user discovers:

`FILE: memory_fragment_03`

The file contains:

`17 / 03 / 04 / 09`

The user discovers these numbers are related to a hidden network connection.

The user runs:

`trace NODE-017`

Ghostnet reveals an unknown connection.

The user connects to the node.

The node contains:

`SIGNAL RECOVERED`

The signal unlocks:

`INCIDENT 014`

Incident 014 contains a missing personnel record.

That record reveals the name of an operator previously absent from the system.

The operator's name unlocks a new command.

The new command reveals an archive directory.

The archive contains a contradiction relating to Incident 0917.

Incident 0917 changes status from:

`UNRESOLVED`

to:

`RECONSTRUCTION AVAILABLE`

This is the kind of cross-system progression I want.

